{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5dec4d5825cbc8c7a4aa9f46be2d23b92c20cea7ad33871411583baac68370df","ja":"3人の決断","zh":"3人的决断","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8c5ba520783195b20d1b55d4fb04a527ffccece2b8cb729f66bb0a2128119f25","ja":"「正解！　日本のエレベーターの定員を決める際の\nひとりあたりの体重はB『65キログラム』です！」","zh":"“回答正确！日本在计算电梯的额定载客人数时，\n按每人体重B‘65公斤’计算！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"33e783cf99b7e3bdf6e642258093d71908b155f110f561d1e627bb77af61432b","ja":"すっげえ！　麗花の『なんとなく』が\nまた当たったじゃん！","zh":"好厉害！丽花的“凭直觉”\n不是又猜中了吗！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7b0a0143b3b8174f23111e000c9afdea42a1584567268ff2c05bce202d742426","ja":"あともう少しで最終問題ですね。\nな、なんだか急に、緊張感がアップしてきました……。","zh":"马上就要到最后一题了呢。\n总、总觉得突然越来越紧张了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1d9eecdbfe9a3ec99604681097ba48153aa150b842d3d0a178dcfbdb86bb5771","ja":"問題もどんどん\nプロフェッショナルになってますし……。","zh":"题目也越来越\n专业了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6137916f303ce60cd4dc2c182e1fe1e877bf3fb0f8e26cb88d6f564526972a41","ja":"そうだね……カンで当てるのも限界あるだろうし。\nそろそろサレンダーを考えた方が良いかも……。","zh":"也是呢……光凭直觉去猜也是有极限的。\n差不多该考虑认输了吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4e92a0fca7ff3480bc8d95b108e26e895800444564f8d45250080cbe1e0b913a","ja":"え～っ、もう終わっちゃうの？\n問題はまだ残ってるよ？","zh":"欸～，这就结束了吗？\n还有题目没做呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fa3283461b408fe006074d9357c1442b28e06320582de8e31c57957ea513bcb4","ja":"そうですけど、\nミステイクするとこれまでの賞金が……。","zh":"虽然是这样，\n但一旦失误，之前的奖金就……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5b128fe88d50bf0fc00cf12ce5c7d517acb1c0552f4720020bdfafb2fea90be9","ja":"でもでも、最後まで頑張った方が\n絶対に楽しいって思うな♪","zh":"不过不过，我觉得坚持努力到最后\n绝对会更开心哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7c97bfeac14a934c0e6b3750659ae208df6766dbec7b9c999d9bc33209715239","ja":"最後まで頑張る……か。\nたしかに、麗花の言うとおりだな！","zh":"坚持到最后……吗。\n确实正如丽花所说的那样啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"256af5ab20a4ffa5a88facb9e511d0e80cc4372f11778280a545d83dcd13f3dc","ja":"はい、ロコはアイドルでした！　トップを目指してる\nアイドルが、途中で諦めるのはよくないですよね！","zh":"是的，ROCO是偶像！以顶峰为目标的\n偶像，半途而废可不好呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ca42de662dec809a40abeb16d4f59d1dbb557440578a2eaa63d162b65f58c83d","ja":"ああ！　……よーし！\nこのまま最後までいこう！","zh":"啊！……好——！\n就这样一口气冲到最后吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f9bae207748d519c125c2de51605e89544a9b66af0f4ff43e29f76ef24112654","ja":"はいっ！　3人で『ダブルアップ』を\n完全制覇しちゃいましょう！","zh":"好！　就让我们3个人一起\n彻底拿下“翻倍”吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7a1c6519df47d3805eed38d75b72c9fa2ff5f80a9ce556ceef6fc654f5e19701","ja":"やったぁ～！　それじゃあみんなで、\n残りの問題をやっつけちゃおっ！！","zh":"太好啦～！那么大家一起，\n把剩下的题目解决掉吧！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1321.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"0b8ccddbd3cddab795bd995cf221f7563025befe45270f63c06ab795989c4184","ja":"ああ、ダンスバトル大会とロコの個展を目指して、\n頑張るぞ！","zh":"啊啊，为了街舞对决大会和ROCO的个展，\n加油吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
